{
  "07e0955075663ed40a2c": {
    "speaker": "炫神",
    "text": "十个座位，八个儿子，两位家长。这次真装得下。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+7%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 5.472,
    "sha256": "1114f606b93e2f5c7dbf80260f5819ce0efe198b5607eaad3a74143cdab3d681"
  },
  "b54be7b3352dac32fc9a": {
    "speaker": "攀哥",
    "text": "人先数齐。生日饭在滨江，下午还有时间逛。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 5.376,
    "sha256": "3c4d90ddf9f0b5ac20f297b6db9aa4d7c017f5714a04f2409e7056cdc9e10890"
  },
  "2d0d3576f31cd7e9dcea": {
    "speaker": "老三",
    "text": "爸爸，天桥上比一圈？我先看好路了！",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 4.56,
    "sha256": "e8367572422ab02a728e22376bbd8352768f3ae373278c070d56068a9964e329"
  },
  "9b098da5edf0a6f9a428": {
    "speaker": "小朋友",
    "text": "只在天桥上跑。别拿过马路当近路。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 4.248,
    "sha256": "5f0a65c186d485774c01ef532850f9791d309c9aab8aa1a95759a84fad812df4"
  },
  "f39d11a5ca3dfd8c3a93": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "元首亲自参赛。输了也不许找妈妈改成绩。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 4.968,
    "sha256": "b03a0abfe9c75512bb0209a9d6372144adcca63cf88b8b64cc23b766ee0f5b3d"
  },
  "aad72189fa45a6baa686": {
    "speaker": "老三",
    "text": "三，二，一！",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 2.784,
    "sha256": "fc9f0687b69c67ec27d6886cdf0e192cbe91e95ddf392bf99a2fdfb12eba8fe1"
  },
  "6c728f0d70d2c6561a8f": {
    "speaker": "老三",
    "text": "再来一次？这次你不能说在让着我。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 4.008,
    "sha256": "7307d459d303f0dae60db7990b5e8b274088aa523f182f3b9e3d1a47198666b5"
  },
  "67d55db5fb9723e03950": {
    "speaker": "炫神",
    "text": "蛋糕已经订好了。我把全家车停在中心绿地旁边，你来开。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+7%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 6.072,
    "sha256": "4bd500c869e5393a60a39268f0d726bf1137f9cb560f3636b907b052d93daffc"
  },
  "f795d37052a70b1b9eab": {
    "speaker": "老五",
    "text": "爸爸，快一点可以，蛋糕别翻。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 3.504,
    "sha256": "7b3e7675ef85c9f24c21e8c7ed3b491e90667cfe71e83251886fa4fa3dc8a6d4"
  },
  "f98e244203f864d65674": {
    "speaker": "小朋友",
    "text": "都坐好了，八个。滨江见，不赶时间。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 4.608,
    "sha256": "33fb4f752042f16c1b16bc3a385f25223e5fc6652f60f474b7549de0e2505a3d"
  },
  "418efee1ebe3ca279c10": {
    "speaker": "老五",
    "text": "它刚才是不是歪了一下？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 2.784,
    "sha256": "ba2e428b25a53aa6aa7fe4e462d8ea158f39795b697d2c36cd7d2fb61ff421ef"
  },
  "e5e025ab89174561f53b": {
    "speaker": "老七",
    "text": "八个都到了。蛋糕也到了。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 3.408,
    "sha256": "920d0b95ef7298abedc657e31223dfe23c362193d8513b33b4da142774266adf"
  },
  "d0c480d728f60c33439e": {
    "speaker": "炫神",
    "text": "奶油有点歪。能吃，别给元首拍特写。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+7%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 4.56,
    "sha256": "00ff7887eb9b409fd2f7268e6db913ba37f46099398417057cbc1c60061cd81a"
  },
  "5f57d2ee29f05f93a4e9": {
    "speaker": "象象",
    "text": "店里坐不下这么多人，借了这个地方。今天先好好吃。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 5.472,
    "sha256": "2590661bafd57a40818fdf0ed2ea9553ab3b9183a8f7f452564732b183a16341"
  },
  "b8f1497c71c32c0fda00": {
    "speaker": "老大",
    "text": "第一幕，海豚帮成立！我演爸爸！",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 4.224,
    "sha256": "e20f0ae5f6e753dff998659814d68dd33c77d41963c94eaa59e24e7be0836699"
  },
  "075fa92760bbcdb32867": {
    "speaker": "老四",
    "text": "等一下，音乐还没开始！",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 2.952,
    "sha256": "2a366ade79eea4b697b8d1832d0ef87ef93da147bc6cbe47c0020119c8aec9cc"
  },
  "2e9d3787b0e745999f97": {
    "speaker": "攀哥",
    "text": "我出去接个人。你们先演，两分钟。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 4.152,
    "sha256": "2abdb285c650fddf5294636372f8f88d13937fbb15309e8f44faf2e4fe6e98d5"
  },
  "ae2eea32f3fa4a8a8589": {
    "speaker": "小朋友",
    "text": "攀哥的手机落在这里了。豚师，出去看看。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 4.896,
    "sha256": "e1a7b9234db0fb4d0f739dbf037e13a4977b649db52096ce5521d9cc313fb3fa"
  },
  "20eca60fbd136bfecfff": {
    "speaker": "工作人员",
    "text": "他们把门堵了！后面还有人！",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 3.384,
    "sha256": "eaebba4748bb1bc50c9c5c472bd7b5f98cda5fcb25107a3da7bd7dc45940a75b"
  },
  "162d1d71fabd0a47eb1e": {
    "speaker": "小朋友",
    "text": "听歌，带孩子上车。豚师，帮工作人员出来！",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 5.04,
    "sha256": "192db3f74ac6713502c83a83fad386430c606fd57e6d7ac8c3aea6b6b82b2fcb"
  },
  "3983f1e7b2d9342fc35d": {
    "speaker": "炫神",
    "text": "车在南出口！后勤门能挡住那边的人，开关在门内侧！",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+7%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 5.568,
    "sha256": "096320a7ec7da6f78a43af040c30e90e7723699d6cb7bc351581a1380372a60e"
  },
  "2d66ef5ed022bef55fe7": {
    "speaker": "炫神",
    "text": "门挡住了。先救里面的人！",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+7%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 3.288,
    "sha256": "ee84bfa7fc527231340dbd743ab8bc095a4fca558adcb037abe5c2a30ce244fe"
  },
  "03ad63f3790887937700": {
    "speaker": "听歌",
    "text": "孩子全在车上。还在院里的，跟着工作人员走！",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "-4%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 6.0,
    "sha256": "320ac3f9330d8069162d31d62e3313acc8308a1626f0c6d78ba80063045c48c7"
  },
  "496b59bf9d7e361de4eb": {
    "speaker": "炫神",
    "text": "攀哥被他们带走了。车已经出了这个街口。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+7%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 4.32,
    "sha256": "697964311659556291e1fc409ba65bde57cfc9a68d4f5eb620fa85fdea3b059f"
  },
  "7b3f9d9ebc8d98ae4fcb": {
    "speaker": "老七",
    "text": "我们八个都在。攀叔叔还没回来。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 3.84,
    "sha256": "ea68a41178a2dda718bd9a864f7f585fc76d577b24cf84aa1671cc84dc5c96ab"
  },
  "3a243b84e5f002989042": {
    "speaker": "老八",
    "text": "爸爸，你的蛋糕。我没让他们切走。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 4.2,
    "sha256": "36ffa4fd41a1dccd0974a275563742e7f0bf7ccf03f4e701177544fcd6d8aa65"
  },
  "0cc0dede33fe41e7178f": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "我去接攀哥。炫神跟我去，听歌留在这边。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 4.464,
    "sha256": "694b9b51b5290dc8a587a14c94decdb5a3710a6dc15112629db74705213704b3"
  },
  "e4092e0d66bc2d78baaa": {
    "speaker": "小朋友",
    "text": "到了先联系我。孩子们的节目，下次要看完。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 4.848,
    "sha256": "ba044be3e6d0bab1bde09e6aec442dda62493df7007e077361ddd000f69fd93e"
  },
  "2c0313383dc92a5a10d1": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "嗯。先把人接回来。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 2.904,
    "sha256": "825e4680a90d7109215ee3dc070ec2edf2da274f6d9f2f2016080bc602bd266a"
  },
  "d3c48ea30346b5773558": {
    "speaker": "老二",
    "text": "我画的地图没画天桥，纸不够高。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 3.744,
    "sha256": "44181ce7436f74b06e46c7aa72b64fc7f37001a07477c6161123bf80951b4026"
  },
  "278cfe4c7a69197e2ca8": {
    "speaker": "老六",
    "text": "攀叔叔说他喜欢这个味道，我帮他留一块。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 4.368,
    "sha256": "5c9f1750683a8eeff3211be12398bce80bdd3b9a4146792844fae285e4458961"
  },
  "a47845f94e9b42666900": {
    "speaker": "老三",
    "text": "爸爸，重拳是这样吗？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 2.832,
    "sha256": "f5db182b6d18f4ee72a698576c7c3927cd13bd888370fac9df1f7671a2dea05f"
  },
  "06b52d2287267c3b6881": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "先别拿弟弟试。拿空气练。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 3.48,
    "sha256": "16de92a44fbdf14f492c3bef7bcb0671d28bf61992eb40a2cad603ecb3d1a932"
  },
  "24615647e55fa4e0d804": {
    "speaker": "听歌",
    "text": "是日，元首亲自运送蛋糕。此事，宜据实记录。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "-4%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 6.408,
    "sha256": "b6d6fc24d50a076fe4db68538760ea8dc3188a9b09b738596fc28f15dc1f94fe"
  },
  "e7c7d346e7a416a65d2e": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "记我开得稳一点。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 2.064,
    "sha256": "2832be3d120969e26d58b9c5f3176ee27869f5f37343bcc35c262bec9ab7af26"
  },
  "a1921f91af48dba8429f": {
    "speaker": "小朋友",
    "text": "醒了？八子计划完成了。你自己生的八个儿子，一个都不少。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 6.432,
    "sha256": "710605fa06b4f8898a87e5e262cfc5630a338090ebc4fb337abcb6da6a33862b"
  },
  "12a41dde812ad243556d": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "八个……只有我玩明白了。就是现在有一点困告。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 4.728,
    "sha256": "69364b3c6be44996e8af8dc39de738bab4ac1ea505e29ea20ae6a34162b8a044"
  },
  "57479b5d0573813b6611": {
    "speaker": "小朋友",
    "text": "先看看孩子。炫神在门口折腾车，我们今天回家。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 5.472,
    "sha256": "f7aa52ed68ac8f344dc17c35f8c96ca935f63d9f347a9445d9873ebf94261604"
  },
  "3d24ea012140bde16fec": {
    "speaker": "攀哥",
    "text": "一、二、三、四……八。等一下，我从这头再数一遍。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 6.888,
    "sha256": "ccd734831f7e02bcfac7d40ae8da559e807218cefefe5678af709ff3d5384265"
  },
  "3c1c604ea65d5c7b6149": {
    "speaker": "炫神",
    "text": "一次解决！我是说八子计划。不是说接人的车。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+7%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 5.184,
    "sha256": "0d92d39895c115d60d656ca7bf7ce3fa1d8220f0ba6002f8561a70560c760553"
  },
  "fb7ddda770a832065c58": {
    "speaker": "听歌",
    "text": "是日，八子俱全。豚师，你往旁边一点，别把老八挡住。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "-4%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 6.792,
    "sha256": "2ac7c655480df84610ad48059884c2fc701f894ee562eea4a70151c7f639d77a"
  },
  "c223fd0b09b415f848a5": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "那岂不是起飞。小朋友，我们怎么把他们带回去？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 5.256,
    "sha256": "24a9508f813404c6b7d86f8e250e6ddc119837f1f8683e4a4712a57d3eb1282c"
  },
  "9c27cdbe4886efbeffb8": {
    "speaker": "小朋友",
    "text": "你去把黄色小车挪到院子后面的蓝色车位。全家车停不进来，行李也还在门边。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 7.512,
    "sha256": "19855b0bb89bf73a544d6026fa2e7d159ec7066ebeffa3e6fd31c48c77099181"
  },
  "48d6cb3c660f8bb9ae14": {
    "speaker": "炫神",
    "text": "放心，我又叫了一辆大车。小黄只负责拉东西，不把八个儿子叠着放。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+7%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 6.816,
    "sha256": "2242f38a66c693f2e20e81636cad2a4623548b1d61bb4ac1b55a8fc35c036d3c"
  },
  "d6f5aa853c09f2d6c9d3": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "本来还想坐着指挥一下。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 2.664,
    "sha256": "d5d389c215e7fc02a00b75bdd63628911c9a0ba218f0f0ff3c2069953c05fd2a"
  },
  "44da20f32c0ef4a39fc9": {
    "speaker": "小朋友",
    "text": "本宫也想。先干活。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 3.048,
    "sha256": "2518c82f5d20b7ea2aa5b7aa3a5971b0d4da6619be8ecae33bbddf7ac7dce6b8"
  },
  "209392ede6681d9498de": {
    "speaker": "小朋友",
    "text": "先看看孩子，再收拾东西。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 3.0,
    "sha256": "add3a72c7b6059069b283e89dc9a13b764cff0e5dbd7b5e0a56a971574778fd0"
  },
  "e47a2cd1e58fad1c652a": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "这次认真看。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 1.872,
    "sha256": "60eb78d02cd419b184be7aa2640e2f5b4abfb218200fa3a4ccfa5134b9f5e1b1"
  },
  "e758dbf975d57650fb21": {
    "speaker": "小朋友",
    "text": "他们最近总凑在一起排节目。你答应看的，可别看一半又困告了。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 6.528,
    "sha256": "4bb7427650e5331aaafbaf7b8123be09050181c65fb70da9c345fdebd37b2ba2"
  },
  "6bfe7111d9442a4f482f": {
    "speaker": "听歌",
    "text": "我带了相机。先拍一张，再挑一张没闭眼的。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "-4%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 5.304,
    "sha256": "f06b4d7d15d15734f61dc437314f584a4a86965556c6f6d9d0d2d72bde80ebd7"
  },
  "e397899a5844bc86e689": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "这个计划可能比八子计划难。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 3.168,
    "sha256": "6768515f46e45147a7b9dc5f86cc34e11e0584465943dee506c3d2d0bfa348e1"
  },
  "80cf20c0cc10ecbde0db": {
    "speaker": "攀哥",
    "text": "我已经数过两遍了。你困归困，回家路上不能再少一个。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 5.856,
    "sha256": "fce84d67965fcb35d2a0983c34588dbd4745558d94013db57e0935d364293302"
  },
  "dee1bba486c0899d25be": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "我也算在里面？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 1.872,
    "sha256": "df39296482f4978788a1710ab994b5f46825da42489684a188b291262d669413"
  },
  "3ed4d8030dad79f53a4c": {
    "speaker": "攀哥",
    "text": "你最容易忘。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 2.016,
    "sha256": "8ae2be92b58a23aa58d2c08c3572039153573ff4635d3f7c5b39452ff5fa84bd"
  },
  "b4a4090ac6bbeb8d152f": {
    "speaker": "炫神",
    "text": "黄色的，能开就行。但八个儿子，真装不下。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+7%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 5.184,
    "sha256": "728ae739e465a0e7bf80a58bcdb3d091b8a55eaa59d33da4a8a4eea73964ebab"
  },
  "5d3788e0d335766c5b92": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "你当年也是这么说的。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 2.256,
    "sha256": "16af9fe9f19189653b10a8dffdfaeb8113a597b2a7ead5108f336666b1989d25"
  },
  "5bd4f5849b007c71a3cd": {
    "speaker": "攀哥",
    "text": "行李装好了。小朋友和孩子坐大车，咱们分开走。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 5.16,
    "sha256": "ead5e66ad1d6059954919b723ef80f3f1d6808e153b505599f67af637f2a0bbb"
  },
  "586812befa835018e935": {
    "speaker": "听歌",
    "text": "先别走！第一次合照，还差摄影师……也差豚师。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "-4%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 5.904,
    "sha256": "9052e352b0c0f72f7fffb4dd53ae7e0f3c8ab3a0b32479952b3265267f08c915"
  },
  "dee10e0df2ed88fec6ce": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "我一直在这儿搬东西。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 2.28,
    "sha256": "f64793074237651b822a154417f12059e16ced94ff7ace79a89947d50d1db9f1"
  },
  "b6973bb36f6b0c71cd6e": {
    "speaker": "听歌",
    "text": "看镜头！八个都在……豚师，你醒一下。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "-4%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 5.184,
    "sha256": "584f819e28b63aa2c634c350182ba59616c06a2782b207134e29a5ea2ff4df8c"
  },
  "1405594e9ee64fd2c589": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "醒着。只有我……困告明白了。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 3.624,
    "sha256": "29d732615bfa9e640da90489d29981e2790bc413f46db74092ccf23058a7591d"
  },
  "c1d841eeedaffe279bc7": {
    "speaker": "攀哥",
    "text": "一到八，全部拍进去了。这张就叫《八子俱全》。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 5.424,
    "sha256": "d11509b2b9716054d1d3f95c59a2364669afceba4cf7f83ce985a417e4279393"
  },
  "d5ef5c3e4a837563ce77": {
    "speaker": "几年以后",
    "text": "八只篮子换成了八张小床。家里总算不用一整夜轮流醒，换成了白天一起闹。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 7.704,
    "sha256": "4430ebfd4f19a2fa35bf2cea444c5740de78a42a30de0459ae8948c8b51341fb"
  },
  "23917e040bd46d539db2": {
    "speaker": "小朋友",
    "text": "八个儿子都会走、会说话了。就是有些话，跟他们爸爸学得太快。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 6.336,
    "sha256": "f44226454b19b1b43ae6c173c7076d7aee3d950aec13000ad2662f39fbe59577"
  },
  "8882f9af20bc0e9e1a71": {
    "speaker": "老三",
    "text": "那岂不是起飞！",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 2.112,
    "sha256": "210551f178836c7d3486a210d281299ef9f65d1a860886f9be997f14e9f74247"
  },
  "28307f7c8eb9eb1f279e": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "这个我可没教。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 1.92,
    "sha256": "7c3df31add09640778bf6721beabe13bb4c3a5959f49fdb1145d97ae06e217fa"
  },
  "b4fd8e595e7d31a36355": {
    "speaker": "老大",
    "text": "我演爸爸。我最大，这个不用争。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 4.08,
    "sha256": "b630ed1770e65d1ae01e17b774a1a2dcbf14e0dc1502d22f729323cc7bfe113a"
  },
  "380546e6a0741a88f51b": {
    "speaker": "老二",
    "text": "我画了上海！这些高楼先放椅子上，别踩我的江。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 5.256,
    "sha256": "f43fb3dd5d90732d87da510c3d2f3c2d9118935d368a1a313c5e3c16720b753f"
  },
  "ba1d55255f24c04a6dc3": {
    "speaker": "老三",
    "text": "那我演爸爸打架的时候！",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 2.616,
    "sha256": "822867f6d1820b7f38cd3152eab8178abf85bfe2209164e9fbd222d5981fc71e"
  },
  "42e091a815b94329be08": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "爸爸也不是每天都打架。先别拿弟弟练。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 4.608,
    "sha256": "4b4d345a042cf1999004f25151b59f2d74eba623223a171b88984bba39d9d175"
  },
  "4166773ac10d978bedc3": {
    "speaker": "老四",
    "text": "听歌叔叔说，可以先来一段音乐。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 3.48,
    "sha256": "f0bdac5c06040575439a1993289433caaf9ce59c58feb0e09a6dfdd693f618c0"
  },
  "5d6871c30c469af9c65d": {
    "speaker": "老五",
    "text": "那什么时候演到吃饭？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 2.424,
    "sha256": "b78de42d30b18bee46ae71be377689d9e14d5f923aa17c37dc3792b485f6c50d"
  },
  "6b2c7cb5830c7cc393c5": {
    "speaker": "老六",
    "text": "我记得攀哥喜欢吃这个。我们带一盒去。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 4.56,
    "sha256": "da906334b8364656e764e60658fe2f9690f02f390e45c30a1c7684d0279fd256"
  },
  "fbeb69adbe8ec352168e": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "别提前吃完就行。也给爸爸留一点。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 3.96,
    "sha256": "8f57b1a7f317a7d4a33ead0ada7f67372535460325ab1ccf26df28b9a1afb6ce"
  },
  "3cc061d6d1d62de01606": {
    "speaker": "老七",
    "text": "一、二……八。爸爸，我数完了，你还要不要再数一遍？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 6.36,
    "sha256": "0b00d1c2a761bd15ab48bfc2805189d7cc8c8a56630b789d72de667e1259462f"
  },
  "82e4234a0b5c462545ec": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "攀哥教你的？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 1.872,
    "sha256": "b1eae48e6a77fafeeee4a2fdfb5b593c6e699ccfe2f2ee1f9f8e8c7541e5963f"
  },
  "6b6e4c63703c4ab7d46d": {
    "speaker": "老八",
    "text": "你先坐。你刚才又站着睡了。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 3.648,
    "sha256": "7421f9eabd8e54565fa69285f0d7bbb80137d2e6ac2094a9f4ea5e4545a534a6"
  },
  "5c6834d99a2e5b7b73e0": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "没有睡。我在想，去上海带你们看什么。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 4.32,
    "sha256": "4c6316d4fc0e1cd5b678a90fe0c3883f889911733ae694bcb8fca3ca0e89146e"
  },
  "41222b8063f4a19878d8": {
    "speaker": "攀哥 · 电话",
    "text": "生日快到了，来上海住一阵？房间都收拾好了。象象说，来多少人都得先吃饭。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 8.304,
    "sha256": "51c13891bde12faa911a44749bd75eceb29237034839e5a75422bb5f9a908ff2"
  },
  "65f8d77b322a0ecc3159": {
    "speaker": "炫神 · 电话",
    "text": "这次车我提前改好了！十个人，真能坐。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+7%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 4.536,
    "sha256": "8fdd38ff19e8fbe9a30835d0e6ddfb1878dd40faa555b636ee9e35d89dd7e7d0"
  },
  "0f2d704f910899405a97": {
    "speaker": "听歌 · 电话",
    "text": "我准备节目。你们慢慢来，别又把自己落在车上。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "-4%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 5.472,
    "sha256": "34c73049e60860416d7b8cdd72f0262de3afce8ddf4466d900c55b167643cb1f"
  },
  "748f349185a777fbf79f": {
    "speaker": "老大",
    "text": "我们也有节目！讲爸爸以前的故事。现在还不能告诉你。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 6.216,
    "sha256": "9c720220ff4fce5001aaa8ac2c6a9dff0711bc9535ddca772fa49df73461c036"
  },
  "8155b0c2b94ca0902ff6": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "好。爸爸这次从第一幕看到最后一幕。再带你们好好逛上海。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 6.888,
    "sha256": "e1d4feff6546eb53f63dab92fcb78d00a87ec9902f84a3f925d24a8e6369605d"
  },
  "27997db761be5bb320e0": {
    "speaker": "老七",
    "text": "一、二……八。爸爸，这次你也站过来。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 5.136,
    "sha256": "f9b7eadd9c32cd857f6b3651a5f03bbbce8846fb3de9b3bbc9fdede337c759d8"
  },
  "8fe239f13d127d5bc00e": {
    "speaker": "老八",
    "text": "合照我收好了。你困了，到了上海再睡。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+4%",
    "pitch": "+18Hz",
    "duration": 4.704,
    "sha256": "73b752eba637db62cf0146ba1a0398234b8d3d73999b9f1144163204d5483906"
  },
  "3d27da1d8046b1e6baeb": {
    "speaker": "小朋友",
    "text": "人都齐了？那就出发。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 3.0,
    "sha256": "70778cc2c344756d72ee8c4c015345bef2d44718911b3e1d7e6bd2ab0c8dd22a"
  },
  "87b5b5a7572c7472cee3": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "齐了。一个都不少。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 2.808,
    "sha256": "ea3cbe68ee21104ee3265d76857f87c76137f8af321ca026620824ee0cba3f5b"
  },
  "110b052a478815cdb754": {
    "speaker": "旁白",
    "text": "一开始，八个人轮流醒，几个大人轮流困。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 4.488,
    "sha256": "57874970b2dc3bf57c0e6a475fb41f30b7251e5ff58a30714fb89cf7edab825f"
  },
  "8953f71734d852638f83": {
    "speaker": "旁白",
    "text": "后来，篮子换成了小床。八个儿子有了八个主意。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 5.544,
    "sha256": "0b0fa06496f549f744b90a4100bd2f6aa2832a0771db3ccd0c49891641f98fd1"
  },
  "5558316787a4f1face04": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "海豚帮解散。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 1.872,
    "sha256": "7eb7af9ea546821134265ddd19b63667c315cdac2e98b3f8fdfc8f1f471384b7"
  },
  "ff08e2c35c373628dd13": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "海豚蒂国成立。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 2.016,
    "sha256": "728909d2ea6835742378a0ca6f4b7d858e4e5864f521e08b05013e3c12dc1409"
  },
  "b98b446ecee9e66222e5": {
    "speaker": "攀哥",
    "text": "人都到齐了。回去吧。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 3.408,
    "sha256": "f03ea96c200ed22899acb00f7f28fdfb706a940ea259359f310f336b29e3d1a7"
  },
  "94e6035043287b232a3c": {
    "speaker": "炫神",
    "text": "车停在北边。元首，回去还得走一段。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
    "rate": "+7%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 4.296,
    "sha256": "1590739fa1d9714e94999a4d293d5cbff1bdc0e8f8f66852ba4d570fa182a35a"
  },
  "530e798b45d677ab8c6b": {
    "speaker": "听歌",
    "text": "是日，天亮了。众人回家。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "-4%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 4.104,
    "sha256": "b8c4c32472d607a0eec401ffabbbc2f17995ce8fd22996c8674412075841a137"
  },
  "bd596e512342985a719e": {
    "speaker": "旁白",
    "text": "长沙的日子，慢慢回到了生活里。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 3.576,
    "sha256": "abb0a77c324d50911f6b21b4bd1f8094276afb771c13cfc44239974ebebeadc7"
  },
  "480913a141a4695a23e3": {
    "speaker": "小朋友",
    "text": "元首，八子计划还算数吗？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 2.952,
    "sha256": "a5a4ca7b083c63bdcd063610c9100a10b83fe2fe11705077626b656e8da32c97"
  },
  "be7be70439099b34ec93": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "当然。一次解决，省得分八次。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 4.032,
    "sha256": "722cfd7edd13d67b4d07b9eee2772624ca834f66f44aa89553a65930a2c913e3"
  },
  "e5daae53c29f46c034da": {
    "speaker": "小朋友",
    "text": "那先起来，去医院。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 2.28,
    "sha256": "01281daeb4d022d8b84ab15ee1a927d2bf6d9c9b2ae77a8537180876d8742dc6"
  },
  "498e874b42c43f990005": {
    "speaker": "豚师",
    "text": "能不能再困告五分钟？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": "-8%",
    "pitch": "-4Hz",
    "duration": 2.52,
    "sha256": "2e51b7b4ff735bf6f4c919312900c3951730f4f1d16884ddc80e7f13eef54788"
  },
  "1991698a010f8da5ecd4": {
    "speaker": "小朋友",
    "text": "不能。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+2Hz",
    "duration": 1.2,
    "sha256": "6ff8b3bcead9b414f120a3623c17dc5a18f9b84f37477cf28e5d46c6633a95a4"
  },
  "900ec78199e0750d3f5d": {
    "speaker": "攀哥 · 电话",
    "text": "你先在后屋待着，别去门口。我晚点过来。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "duration": 4.464,
    "sha256": "ffab5de7e80b652e003ee5ae6d1c774cf3b79da1f4f99b8e4a86e11040bae3e3"
  },
  "e7c4b5217f7013433f46": {
    "speaker": "老八",
